  m_text: 'Hey new capn, just a heads up,


    If you need to get into the locked
    utility closet, just use this code on the dial pad: "3465". They need some extra
    hands in the Industrial Sector so if your in need of any fuses, cleaning supplies
    or whatever, its all in there.


    Have a good one'
